# worktree-swarm

Apply the worktree-swarm skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- validate GitHub issue URLs and repository scope
- create isolated issue worktrees atomically
- launch local agents in parallel
- emit a machine-readable worktree manifest

Stop when: All valid issues have isolated worktrees and local agents, a manifest is written, or validation/creation fails with safe rollback.
